VoiceDrop — Third-Party Notices
===============================

This file lists third-party components redistributed with the VoiceDrop
Android application binary. It complements the per-library license screen
inside the app (Settings → Open Source Licenses, generated by
AboutLibraries) by covering components that are not declared as Maven
dependencies — in particular native code that is statically linked
through a wrapper — and by satisfying the NOTICE-file redistribution
clause of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of this file is shipped inside the APK at
`assets/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES` and is also checked into the source
repository alongside the project's primary LICENSE.

For the canonical license text of each Maven dependency, see the
"Open Source Licenses" screen inside the app.


